  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A clean kit piece looks new. Weather this wall so that it shows where it stands and what happens to it: rain, feet, leaks. Use two or three decals from the ready set and one Material Variant (dirty or wet) of the wall's material. Keep the result as a prefab.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Where on this wall would weathering show first?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. <b>Look:</b> decide where the wall stands (in the rain, under a roof, by a road) and choose three places that would weather.\n2. <b>Weather:</b> drag two or three decals from Packages \u203A Asset Library \u203A Decals \u203A Prefabs onto those places, and make a Material Variant of M_Weather_Plaster for the wall.\n3. <b>Keep:</b> save the weathered wall as a prefab in your own folder.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: stations 1\u20136 of this scene \xB7 Weathering-Material, 4 \xB7 Weathering states</color></size>"
