  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Rain ripples can be a decal too. This one changes only the normals under it: Color Opacity 0, Smoothness Opacity 0, Normal Blend 1. The Ripple Flipbook script swaps its Normal Map through 16 frames, 20 times a second, so the rings spread. Its box covers wet and dry asphalt.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Where do the ripples show more: on the wet asphalt or on the dry asphalt?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, or turn on Always Refresh in the Scene view, and watch from the low camera.\n2. On Decal - Rain ripples, change the Ripple Flipbook's Frames Per Second.\n3. On M_Decal_Rain-Ripples-Station, move Normal Blend between 0 and 1.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Weathering-Shaders, 2 \xB7 Puddles: a mask and a level</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
