      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A decal does not have to change the colour. This puddle decal changes only the smoothness of the asphalt under it: Color Opacity 0, Normal Blend 0, Smoothness 0.95 (shader Mavrodiev > Weathering > Decal-Masked, shaped by a mask).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You look at the puddle from the low camera, near the ground. What do you see in it?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Look through this station's low and high cameras, or orbit the Scene view down to the ground.\n2. On M_Decal_Puddle-Smoothness, raise Normal Blend.\n3. Then raise Color Opacity.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Material-Chart, 1 \xB7 Reference values (wet asphalt)</color></size>"
